    <string name="focus_q">Turn on Focus lock?</string>
    <string name="focus_body">"While today\'s routine isn\'t done, leaving the checklist brings you back to it, and the system bars are hidden on this screen.\n\nYou always stay in control:\n  - Settings, phone calls, emergency and uninstalling are never blocked\n  - Apps you allow for work stay open\n  - %1$d five-minute breaks a day\n  - \"Pause for today\" turns everything off until tomorrow\n\nYou can turn Focus lock off again once today\'s routine is done."</string>
