    <string name="edits_easier_q">Start these changes tomorrow?</string>
    <string name="edits_easier_body">They make today\'s unfinished routine easier, so they\'d unlock your apps early. Saving them for tomorrow keeps today honest. If a habit is simply wrong today, hold the button below to apply them now.</string>
